 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `Files.Upload` for v1 file uploads from a file name and reader without
+  requiring callers to construct a multipart body.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Make v1 `Files.Add` bodies replayable so uploads can retry after rate limits
+  when the source is an `os.File` or another reader without automatic replay.
+
